    ["“安提科勋爵的负债花销和不经营产业是为了维持贵族的体面，这很常见。不允许售卖酒庄里的酒只是因为喜欢美酒，不允许妻子卖酒也可以说成是对妻子的珍视，没有出轨行为，这怎么能算背叛了婚姻呢？”几位律师都是这样的答复。"] = "\"Lord Antigonus's debts and lack of business management were merely to maintain the dignity of a nobleman; this is quite common. Not allowing the sale of wine from the winery was simply because he loved fine wine, and forbidding his wife from selling wine can also be described as cherishing her. There was no infidelity, so how can this be considered a betrayal of marriage?\" These were the replies from several lawyers.",
