    ["偷听了女职员讨论，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">角色的线索</>：\n传闻昨晚并非副队长，而是<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">队长</>持枪出门，在解决掉路上接应凶手的混混后，他亲自击毙了开膛手。\n与居民交流，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">时间的线索</>：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">半夜原本漆黑的夜晚，被刺眼光芒照耀得如同白昼。</>\n与马车夫交流后，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">地点的线索</>：\n那名看似被怪物追杀而慌不择路的少女，实则是故意将凶手引向了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">警局总部。</>"] = "Eavesdropped on the female employees' discussion, obtaining clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> character </>: \nRumor has it that last night it wasn't the deputy captain, but the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">captain</> who went out with a gun. After taking care of the thugs supporting the murderer on the road, he personally shot the Ripper dead. \nCommunicated with the residents, obtaining clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> time </>: \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">The pitch-black night of midnight was illuminated by a blinding light as if it were day. </>\nAfter communicating with the carriage driver, obtained clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> location </>: \nThat young girl, who appeared to be fleeing in panic while being chased by a monster, was actually intentionally leading the murderer to the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">police headquarters. </>",
