    ["去年我在那里度假时，每天醒来窗外都是不同的海岛。<P_Heart>（微笑）</>唯一的麻烦是——有次巨龟和它的女朋友私奔了，我们漂流了三天。"] = "When I vacationed there last year, I woke up to a different island outside my window every day. <P_Heart>(Smiles)</> The only trouble is—once the giant turtle eloped with its girlfriend, and we drifted for three days.",
    ["向友方目标快速突进，解除终点区域内友方受到的弱控和减速，并为其提供15%的减伤和25%的加速，持续5秒。\n施法后若自身未处于<HighLight>力量真空</>状态，则<Highlight>3</>秒内本技能变为<HighLight>王庭号令</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>黄昏印记</>\n使<HighLight>终结技能</>和<HighLight>怒意猛击</>得到强化，最多持有6枚。\n<FaintYellow>力量真空</>\n持续时间内无法使用<HighLight>王庭号令</>。"] = "Dash rapidly toward a friendly target, removing soft crowd control and slow effects from allies in the destination area, and providing them with 15% Damage Reduction and 25% Acceleration for 5 seconds. \nIf you are not in the <HighLight>Power Vacuum</> state after casting, this skill becomes <HighLight>Royal Court Command</> for <Highlight>3</> seconds. \n\n<FaintYellow>Dusk Mark</>\nStrengthens <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> and <HighLight>Angry Slam</>, stacking up to 6 times. \n<FaintYellow>Power Vacuum</>\nYou cannot use <HighLight>Royal Court Command</> during this duration.",
