    ["您好，我是马蒂尼，是这儿的调酒师。"] = "Hello, I am Martini, the bartender here.",
    ["成就-拆弹专家"] = "Achievement - Bomb Disposal Expert",
    ["我为了多赚些钱给杰姆治病，只能一个人出来工作。但我一个人应付不来……就像刚才，差点摔死在烟囱里……"] = "To earn more money for Jem's treatment, I have to work alone. But I can't handle it by myself... just like earlier, I almost fell to my death in the chimney...",
