    ["是那场碎尸案，女神庇佑……克莱恩，你快点去找邓恩队长吧，我担心他等急了。"] = "It's that dismemberment case, may the Goddess protect us... Klein, hurry and go find Captain Dunn; I'm worried he's been waiting anxiously.",
